title: $:/ControlPanel/Settings/FileBackups/Awareness

\procedure fb-global-default(key, unit)
<$let g={{{ [<key>get[text]] ~[[0]] }}} ><span class="fb-hint">Global default: <%if [<g>match[0]] %>off<%else%><<g>> <<unit>><%endif%></span></$let>
\end

!! Backup awareness (this wiki)

These reminders are ''off by default'' (opt-in). A reminder runs only when its value is above 0.

Each field below applies to ''this wiki only''. Leave it ''empty'' to use the global default shown beside it (set in the browser AddOn options). Enter a ''number'' to override the default for this wiki. Entering ''0'' turns that reminder off for this wiki, even when the global default is on.

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr; gap:0.4em 0.8em; align-items:start; margin:0.6em 0;">
<div>Remind me if I haven't saved a milestone in this many days:</div>
<div><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/file-backups/remindAfterDays" tag="input" type="number" class="fb-num" placeholder="global default" default=""/><<fb-global-default "$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/global/remindAfterDays" "days">></div>
<div>Remind me when the backup folder holds more than this many files:</div>
<div><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/file-backups/fileCountLimit" tag="input" type="number" class="fb-num" placeholder="global default" default=""/><<fb-global-default "$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/global/fileCountLimit" "files">></div>
<div>Remind me when backups use more than this much disk space (MB):</div>
<div><$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/file-backups/sizeLimitMB" tag="input" type="number" class="fb-num" placeholder="global default" default=""/><<fb-global-default "$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/global/sizeLimitMB" "MB">></div>
</div>
